          </span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface mt-0.5">Phased Implementation Roadmap</h2>
</div>
<span class="font-code-sm text-code-sm text-outline hidden md:block">Total Expected Effort: ~65 Engineering Hours</span>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-space-md">
<!-- Phase 1 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all">
<div class="space-y-space-sm">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-code-sm text-code-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-container-highest text-secondary font-bold">PHASE 01</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-tertiary">Week 1: Core Engine</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">In-Memory Concurrent Engine</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Build the deterministic state machine. Implement lock-free or striped RWMutex skip-lists capable of over 100k operations per second with microsecond read latencies.
            </p>
<div class="p-space-sm bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg font-code-sm text-code-sm text-on-surface space-y-1">
<div class="text-outline-variant font-medium">// Key Interfaces</div>
<div><span class="text-primary">Apply</span>(cmd Command) Result</div>
<div><span class="text-secondary">Get</span>(key []byte) ([]byte, bool)</div>
<div><span class="text-tertiary">CreateSnapshot</span>() SnapshotHandle</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md flex flex-wrap gap-1">
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Skip-Lists</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">RWMutex Stripping</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Zero-Copy Slices</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Phase 2 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all">
<div class="space-y-space-sm">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-code-sm text-code-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-container-highest text-primary font-bold">PHASE 02</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-tertiary">Week 2: Consensus</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Raft Core &amp; Elections</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              State transitions between Follower, Candidate, and Leader. Randomized election timeouts (150ms–300ms) with heartbeat ticker channels to prevent split-vote thrashing.
            </p>
<div class="p-space-sm bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg font-code-sm text-code-sm text-on-surface space-y-1">
<div class="text-outline-variant font-medium">// Timers &amp; Quorums</div>
<div>timer = randTimeout(150, 300)</div>
<div>if votes &gt; len(peers)/2 { <span class="text-tertiary">becomeLeader()</span> }</div>
<div>broadcastHeartbeats(tick=50ms)</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md flex flex-wrap gap-1">
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">RPC Timers</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Term Invariants</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Atomic Swaps</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Phase 3 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all">
<div class="space-y-space-sm">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-code-sm text-code-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-container-highest text-secondary font-bold">PHASE 03</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-tertiary">Week 2–3: Durability</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Log Replication &amp; Safety</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Replicate log entries across followers using AppendEntries. Manage leader <code class="text-secondary font-code-sm">matchIndex</code> and <code class="text-secondary font-code-sm">nextIndex</code>. Enforce Raft log matching invariants.
            </p>
<div class="p-space-sm bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg font-code-sm text-code-sm text-on-surface space-y-1">
<div class="text-outline-variant font-medium">// Log Repair Engine</div>
<div>if entry.Term != log[prevLogIndex].Term {</div>
<div class="pl-2 text-error">rejectAppend(); nextIndex[peer]--</div>
<div>}</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md flex flex-wrap gap-1">
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Write-Ahead Log</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Commit Index Safety</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">gRPC Streams</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Phase 4 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all">
<div class="space-y-space-sm">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-code-sm text-code-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-container-highest text-tertiary font-bold">PHASE 04</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-tertiary">Week 3: Memory Safety</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Log Snapshot Compaction</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Prevent infinite disk and memory growth. Discard applied log entries by creating periodic point-in-time state machine snapshots and streaming them via <code class="text-tertiary font-code-sm">InstallSnapshot</code> to lagging nodes.
            </p>
<div class="p-space-sm bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg font-code-sm text-code-sm text-on-surface space-y-1">
<div class="text-outline-variant font-medium">// Compaction Trigger</div>
<div>if log.Bytes() &gt; maxThreshold {</div>
<div class="pl-2 text-tertiary">compactToSnapshot(lastApplied)</div>
<div>}</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md flex flex-wrap gap-1">
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Dynamic Cluster Reconfig</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded font-code-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">Snapshot Chunks</span>
</div>
</div>
